0,Temoq language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temoq_language,"Temoq is a severely endangered Austroasiatic language spoken in the state of Pahang in the Malay Peninsula. Temoq belongs to the Southern branch of the Aslian languages, along with Semelai, Semaq Beri, and Mah Meri.",Temoq,Austro-Asiatic
