2,Temoq language,https://grokipedia.com/page/temoq_language,"The suprasegmental features of Temoq, a Southern Aslian language, align with broader patterns in the Aslian branch of Austroasiatic, featuring iambic stress on the final (main) syllable of words, which contributes to a rhythmic prosody emphasizing word endings.",Temoq,Austro-Asiatic
